---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="El Dorado | Atlas Aeterna"
  description="Explore the legend of El Dorado, its location and the history of the search for the legendary source of extraordinary wealth."
>
  <article class="case-page">
    <!-- -------------------------------- -->
    <!-- CASE HEADER                      -->
    <!-- -------------------------------- -->

    <section class="case-header">
      <svg
        class="header-contours"
        viewBox="0 0 620 620"
        fill="none"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M-36 448C42 357 98 386 158 314C216 245 221 157 318 112C414 67 499 107 656 -14" />
        <path d="M-18 485C63 396 128 418 190 346C254 270 263 188 354 143C450 96 529 131 651 39" />
        <path d="M7 523C85 446 159 453 224 384C294 311 304 225 390 182C476 139 548 155 644 95" />
        <path d="M48 562C124 504 189 499 260 432C334 363 349 284 426 241C500 200 562 204 637 164" />
        <path d="M114 601C187 549 246 544 314 485C383 423 400 347 468 304C530 265 582 264 637 241" />
      </svg>

      <div class="case-object" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="case-object__orbit case-object__orbit--outer"></span>
        <span class="case-object__orbit case-object__orbit--middle"></span>
        <span class="case-object__orbit case-object__orbit--inner"></span>
        <span class="case-object__axis"></span>

        <span class="case-object__sphere">
          <span class="case-object__latitude case-object__latitude--one"></span>
          <span class="case-object__latitude case-object__latitude--two"></span>
          <span class="case-object__meridian"></span>
        </span>

        <span class="case-object__node case-object__node--one"></span>
        <span class="case-object__node case-object__node--two"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="case-header__content">
        <h1>El Dorado</h1>

        <p class="case-intro">
          El Dorado is one of history’s most enduring legends, a 
          tale of gold, discovery and a hidden land of extraordinary 
          wealth somewhere in the vast landscapes of South America.
        </p>
      </div>

      <span class="edge-mark edge-mark--top-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="edge-mark edge-mark--top-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="edge-mark edge-mark--bottom-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="edge-mark edge-mark--bottom-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </section>


    <!-- -------------------------------- -->
    <!-- LOCATION                         -->
    <!-- -------------------------------- -->

    <section class="content-section map-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h2>Location</h2>
        <span class="section-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>

      <figure class="map-card">
        <div class="map-viewport">
          <span class="map-grid" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="map-compass" aria-hidden="true"></span>

          <div class="map-world">
            <img
              class="map-image"
              src="/blank-map-world.svg"
              alt="World map showing the approximate region associated with El Dorado"
              loading="lazy"
            />

            <div
              class="map-marker"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <span class="marker-area"></span>
              <span class="marker-core"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figcaption class="map-caption">
          Approximate region associated with the origins of the El Dorado legend in present-day Colombia.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>


    <!-- -------------------------------- -->
    <!-- TIMELINE                         -->
    <!-- -------------------------------- -->

    <section class="content-section timeline-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h2>Timeline</h2>
        <span class="section-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-shell">
        <div class="timeline">
          <!-- EVENT 1 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                Before European Contact
              </p>

              <h3>The Sacred Lake</h3>

              <p>
                Lake Guatavita formed part of a sacred Muisca landscape where ritual offerings were made, traditions that would 
                later become closely connected with the legend of El Dorado.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- EVENT 2 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                1537
              </p>

              <h3>The Spanish Encounter the Muisca</h3>

              <p>
                Gonzalo Jiménez de Quesada and his expedition enter Muisca territory, beginning Spanish contact with the 
                culture and region that would become central to the El Dorado legend.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- EVENT 3 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                1562
              </p>

              <h3>The Search Turns to Guatavita</h3>

              <p>
                Antonio de Sepúlveda receives royal permission to recover the riches believed to lie beneath Lake Guatavita, 
                beginning an ambitious effort to uncover its hidden offerings.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- EVENT 4 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                1590–1595
              </p>

              <h3>The Legend Moves East</h3>

              <p>
                Spanish expeditions push the search for El Dorado into Guiana and the Orinoco, where the legend becomes 
                increasingly associated with Manoa, a great city or kingdom of extraordinary wealth.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- EVENT 5 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                1595–1618
              </p>

              <h3>Raleigh’s Search for El Dorado</h3>

              <p>
                Walter Raleigh leads two expeditions into Guiana in pursuit of El Dorado, exploring the Orinoco and searching for 
                the great golden city of Manoa. His final expedition ends in disaster.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- EVENT 6 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                1911–1912
              </p>

              <h3>Guatavita Is Drained</h3>

              <p>
                An ambitious British operation lowers the lake in search of its legendary treasure, revealing the difficult mud-
                covered floor beneath the waters.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- EVENT 7 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                1969
              </p>

              <h3>A Legend Cast in Gold</h3>

              <p>
                A remarkable gold raft is discovered in a cave near Pasca, Cundinamarca. The Muisca votive piece depicts a 
                ceremonial scene closely associated with the traditions surrounding El Dorado.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- EVENT 8 -->

          <article class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p class="timeline-date">
                2009
              </p>

              <h3>Archaeology Returns to Guatavita</h3>

              <p>
                An archaeological survey around Lake Guatavita uncovers evidence of a Muisca shrine and ritual offerings, 
                revealing more about the sacred landscape at the heart of the El Dorado legend.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .case-page {
    --case-blue: #84a9ee;
    --case-gold: #d9ad72;
    --case-violet: #a58bd9;

    padding: 18px 0 38px;
  }


  /* ---------------------------------- */
  /* CASE HEADER                        */
  /* ---------------------------------- */

  .case-header {
    min-height: 540px;

    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;

    overflow: hidden;

    padding:
      clamp(68px, 8vw, 108px)
      clamp(28px, 7vw, 92px);

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 8% 7%,
        rgba(116, 171, 255, 0.28),
        transparent 34%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 91% 8%,
        rgba(230, 176, 112, 0.30),
        transparent 37%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 60% 112%,
        rgba(171, 143, 224, 0.20),
        transparent 41%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        142deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.77),
        rgba(247, 249, 255, 0.46) 46%,
        rgba(255, 248, 241, 0.50)
      );

    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.89);
    border-radius: clamp(30px, 3.2vw, 48px);

    box-shadow:
      0 44px 110px rgba(50, 62, 88, 0.13),
      0 12px 34px rgba(50, 62, 88, 0.07),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(58, 69, 94, 0.045);

    backdrop-filter:
      blur(30px)
      saturate(155%);

    -webkit-backdrop-filter:
      blur(30px)
      saturate(155%);
  }


  .case-header::after {
    content: "";

    position: absolute;
    inset: 1px;
    z-index: 5;

    border-radius: inherit;

    background:
      linear-gradient(
        112deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.59),
        transparent 26%,
        transparent 72%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.20)
      );

    mask-image:
      linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        black,
        transparent 24%,
        transparent 76%,
        black
      );

    -webkit-mask-image:
      linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        black,
        transparent 24%,
        transparent 76%,
        black
      );

    opacity: 0.54;
    pointer-events: none;
  }


  .case-header__content {
    width: min(67%, 820px);

    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;

    animation:
      content-enter
      0.85s
      var(--ease-out)
      both;
  }


  h1 {
    margin: 0;

    background:
      linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        #171922 0%,
        #292d39 66%,
        #454a57 100%
      );

    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;

    font-size: clamp(68px, 9.4vw, 132px);
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: 0.038em;
    text-wrap: balance;

    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;

    filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.36));
  }


  .case-intro {
    max-width: 760px;

    margin: 29px 0 0;

    color: #606775;

    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.9vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.78;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }


  .header-contours {
    width: min(53vw, 690px);

    position: absolute;
    right: -15%;
    bottom: -43%;
    z-index: -2;

    color: rgba(87, 70, 52, 0.16);

    opacity: 0.48;
    transform: rotate(-11deg);
    pointer-events: none;
  }


  .header-contours path {
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.15;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }


  /* ---------------------------------- */
  /* CASE OBJECT                        */
  /* ---------------------------------- */

  .case-object {
    width: clamp(380px, 42vw, 610px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    position: absolute;
    top: 49%;
    right: clamp(-175px, -6vw, -34px);
    z-index: 1;

    opacity: 0.80;

    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 34px 40px rgba(83, 67, 49, 0.14));

    transform: translateY(-50%);
    pointer-events: none;

    animation:
      object-float
      10s
      ease-in-out
      infinite;
  }


  .case-object__sphere {
    width: 56%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;

    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 29% 22%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.44) 19%,
        rgba(240, 205, 156, 0.27) 48%,
        rgba(195, 157, 111, 0.16) 67%,
        rgba(144, 155, 205, 0.12) 88%
      );

    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    border-radius: 50%;

    box-shadow:
      inset 19px 23px 35px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.50),
      inset -25px -35px 49px rgba(150, 112, 68, 0.17),
      0 37px 69px rgba(100, 79, 55, 0.15);

    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }


  .case-object__sphere::before {
    content: "";

    width: 68%;
    height: 34%;

    position: absolute;
    top: 7%;
    left: 13%;

    border-radius: 50%;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78),
        transparent 70%
      );

    filter: blur(7px);
    transform: rotate(-24deg);
  }


  .case-object__sphere::after {
    content: "";

    width: 56%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    position: absolute;
    right: -5%;
    bottom: -14%;

    border-radius: 50%;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle,
        rgba(220, 157, 88, 0.26),
        transparent 70%
      );

    filter: blur(5px);
  }


  .case-object__latitude,
  .case-object__meridian {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;

    display: block;

    border: 1px solid rgba(82, 61, 41, 0.17);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }


  .case-object__latitude {
    width: 84%;
    height: 30%;
  }


  .case-object__latitude--one {
    transform:
      translate(-50%, -50%)
      rotate(-7deg);
  }


  .case-object__latitude--two {
    width: 72%;
    height: 20%;

    transform:
      translate(-50%, -50%)
      rotate(-7deg)
      translateY(510%);
  }


  .case-object__meridian {
    width: 38%;
    height: 86%;

    transform:
      translate(-50%, -50%)
      rotate(16deg);
  }


  .case-object__orbit {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;

    display: block;

    border: 1px solid rgba(83, 63, 44, 0.19);
    border-radius: 50%;

    box-shadow:
      0 0 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52),
      inset 0 0 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
  }


  .case-object__orbit--outer {
    width: 93%;
    height: 35%;

    transform:
      translate(-50%, -50%)
      rotate(-18deg);
  }


  .case-object__orbit--middle {
    width: 80%;
    height: 80%;

    border-color: rgba(86, 68, 49, 0.14);

    transform:
      translate(-50%, -50%)
      rotate(31deg);
  }


  .case-object__orbit--inner {
    width: 41%;
    height: 92%;

    border-color: rgba(86, 68, 49, 0.16);

    transform:
      translate(-50%, -50%)
      rotate(28deg);
  }


  .case-object__axis {
    width: 1px;
    height: 90%;

    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;

    display: block;

    background:
      linear-gradient(
        transparent,
        rgba(80, 61, 44, 0.22) 18%,
        rgba(80, 61, 44, 0.22) 82%,
        transparent
      );

    transform:
      translate(-50%, -50%)
      rotate(28deg);
  }


  .case-object__node {
    width: 13px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    position: absolute;

    display: block;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 32% 26%,
        white,
        rgba(247, 220, 178, 0.81) 42%,
        rgba(143, 102, 62, 0.44)
      );

    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90);
    border-radius: 50%;

    box-shadow:
      0 8px 16px rgba(92, 69, 46, 0.18),
      inset 0 1px 0 white;
  }


  .case-object__node--one {
    top: 24%;
    right: 7%;
  }


  .case-object__node--two {
    width: 9px;

    bottom: 18%;
    left: 15%;
  }


  /* ---------------------------------- */
  /* CONTENT SECTIONS                   */
  /* ---------------------------------- */

  .content-section {
    width: min(100%, 1080px);

    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 74px 0 8px;
  }


  .section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 28px;

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;

    gap: 15px;
  }


  .section-number {
    width: 34px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    display: grid;
    place-items: center;

    color: #7b8291;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        145deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.80),
        rgba(241, 245, 252, 0.53)
      );

    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.91);
    border-radius: 50%;

    box-shadow:
      0 8px 18px rgba(55, 67, 95, 0.10),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);

    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }


  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;

    color: #1d2029;

    font-size: clamp(33px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: 0.012em;
  }


  .section-rule {
    height: 1px;

    display: block;

    background:
      linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(65, 76, 102, 0.16),
        transparent
      );
  }


  /* ---------------------------------- */
  /* MAP CARD                           */
  /* ---------------------------------- */

  .map-card {
    width: 100%;

    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(18px, 2.6vw, 30px);

    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;

    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;

    gap: 23px;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 8% 3%,
        rgba(117, 171, 255, 0.16),
        transparent 30%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 93% 96%,
        rgba(230, 175, 111, 0.16),
        transparent 32%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        145deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.79),
        rgba(246, 249, 255, 0.50)
      );

    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.91);
    border-radius: clamp(24px, 2.7vw, 34px);

    box-shadow:
      0 24px 60px rgba(50, 62, 88, 0.10),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(55, 65, 88, 0.04);

    backdrop-filter:
      blur(24px)
      saturate(150%);

    -webkit-backdrop-filter:
      blur(24px)
      saturate(150%);
  }


  .map-card::before {
    content: "";

    position: absolute;
    inset: 1px;
    z-index: -1;

    border-radius: inherit;

    background:
      linear-gradient(
        112deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.54),
        transparent 28%,
        transparent 74%,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.17)
      );

    opacity: 0.55;
    pointer-events: none;
  }


  .map-viewport {
    width: 100%;

    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;

    aspect-ratio: 16 / 8.5;

    overflow: hidden;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 18% 10%,
        rgba(121, 172, 248, 0.12),
        transparent 36%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 88% 92%,
        rgba(221, 170, 110, 0.12),
        transparent 38%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        145deg,
        rgba(239, 244, 251, 0.74),
        rgba(250, 247, 244, 0.70)
      );

    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    border-radius: clamp(18px, 2vw, 25px);

    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92),
      inset 0 0 42px rgba(86, 102, 137, 0.06);
  }


  .map-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;

    display: block;

    opacity: 0.18;

    background-image:
      linear-gradient(
        rgba(62, 74, 100, 0.13) 1px,
        transparent 1px
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        rgba(62, 74, 100, 0.13) 1px,
        transparent 1px
      );

    background-size: 54px 54px;

    mask-image:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 50% 50%,
        black,
        transparent 78%
      );

    -webkit-mask-image:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 50% 50%,
        black,
        transparent 78%
      );

    pointer-events: none;
  }


  .map-compass {
    width: clamp(54px, 7vw, 82px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    position: absolute;
    right: clamp(15px, 2.6vw, 30px);
    bottom: clamp(15px, 2.6vw, 30px);
    z-index: 3;

    display: block;

    border: 1px solid rgba(71, 78, 96, 0.20);
    border-radius: 50%;

    opacity: 0.38;
    pointer-events: none;
  }


  .map-compass::before,
  .map-compass::after {
    content: "";

    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;

    background: rgba(71, 78, 96, 0.24);

    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }


  .map-compass::before {
    width: 1px;
    height: 72%;
  }


  .map-compass::after {
    width: 72%;
    height: 1px;
  }


  /*
    THIS IS THE ZOOMED WORLD MAP.

    width controls the zoom.

    left moves the world map
    horizontally.

    top moves the world map
    vertically.
  */

  .map-world {
    width: 250%;

    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;

    left: -20%;
    top: -70%;
  }


  .map-image {
    width: 125%;

    display: block;

    opacity: 0.78;

    filter:
      grayscale(100%)
      contrast(1.04)
      sepia(8%);
  }


  /*
    These percentages are positions on
    the FULL WORLD MAP rather than
    positions inside the visible card.
  */

  .map-marker {
    width: 5%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    position: absolute;

    top: 47.5%;
    left: 27.5%;

    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }


  .marker-area {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;

    display: block;

    background: rgba(222, 171, 99, 0.20);

    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 142, 70, 0.23);
    border-radius: 50%;

    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 8px rgba(228, 183, 119, 0.06),
      0 10px 30px rgba(150, 101, 49, 0.16),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.48);

    backdrop-filter: blur(0.7px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.7px);

    animation:
      marker-pulse
      3.4s
      ease-in-out
      infinite;
  }


  .marker-core {
    width: 14%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;

    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;

    display: block;

    background: rgba(130, 88, 44, 0.70);
    border-radius: 50%;

    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26),
      0 4px 12px rgba(105, 69, 36, 0.22);

    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }


  .map-caption {
    max-width: 640px;

    margin: 0 auto;

    color: #858b99;

    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.72;
    letter-spacing: 0.025em;
